In a pure display of power, you project a ranged melee attack, doing [139%, 159%, 175%, 188%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

If the target is outside of melee range, you have a chance to project a second attack against it for [51%, 73%, 91%, 107%, 121% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

The second strike chance (which increases with distance) is [8.4%, 15%, 20%, 25%, 29% (TL1-5)] at range 2 and [29%, 45%, 56%, 64%, 70% (TL1-5; STR 100)] at the maximum range of [2, 4, 6, 8, 10 (STR 10-100)].

The range will increase with your Strength.
